  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objectives are to sustainably develop the Fili&#xe8;res by taking advantage of the diversity of unique terroirs in the region, with profitable inclusion of organized smallholder producers, young people and women, and strengthening the ability of smallholders to make effective and rational use of socio-economic potential within value chains.</narrative>
